cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its study, please cite it as follows."
title: "DC-Resilience: A Reproducible Monte Carlo Workbench for Data Centre Redundancy Architectures"
authors:
  - family-names: Deokar
    given-names: Romit
  - family-names: Saran
    given-names: Shourya
type: software
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-01"
abstract: >-
  A FastAPI + React research console that evaluates N, N+1 and 2N data centre
  redundancy architectures with a continuous-time renewal Monte Carlo engine,
  paired random streams, exact outage-interval integration and Clopper-Pearson
  uncertainty intervals.
keywords:
  - data centre
  - reliability
  - redundancy
  - Monte Carlo
  - availability
